  <h2>What multi day hikes are in Tasmania?</h2>
  <p>
    Tasmania's best-known multi-day walks fall into two groups: booked,
    fee-based tracks with a fixed capacity, and unbooked walks where you carry
    everything and register only if the park asks you to. The table below covers
    the routes most first-time overnight hikers ask about.
  </p>

